<p>haaye kis bekas-o mazloom ka ye maatam hai<br />
fatema aayi hai rone ko ye kis ka gham hai<br />
nange sar saath hai hoore'n bhi ajab aalam hai<br />
rone walo'n se ye irshaad bhi to paiham hai</p>

<p>rone waalo tumhe rone ka silaa dene ko<br />
fatema aai hai tum sab ko dua dene ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye azadaro tumhe qaaliqe akbar ki qasam<br />
koun mazloom hai wo tum ko payambar ki qasam<br />
naam lo uska zubaa'n se tumhe hyder ki qasam<br />
be zabaa'n hasliyo'n wale ali asghar ki qasam</p>

<p>roke kehdo ke koi bekas-o maghmoom nahi<br />
juz hussain ibn-e ali aur koi mazloom nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yahi mazloom madine ka hai rahne wala<br />
ek saidaani ne faaqou'n me jise tha paala<br />
nayyar-e burj-e imaamat ka yahi hai haala<br />
ek bekas pa sitam hai ye falak ne daala</p>

<p>subha se asr talak ghar ko lutaaya is ne<br />
margaye sab to gala apna kataya is ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shabe haf-tum se huwa bandh isi par paani<br />
isi mazloom ke qismat me ye thi hairaani<br />
zibha jab hota tha ran me jo ali ka jaani<br />
peet-ti phirti thi maqtal me koi saidaani</p>

<p>koun saidaani wahi fatema ki jaayi thi<br />
bhai ke pyar me sar nange nikal aaye thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haan payambar ke madine ka musaafir hai yahi<br />
apne naana ki lahad ka bhi mujaawer hai yahi<br />
jisko paani na mila tha dam-e- aqir hai yahi<br />
jis pa sadqe huwe ayyub wa saabir hai yahi</p>

<p>bekas-o be watan-o tashnadahan kehte hai<br />
isi mazloom ko mohtaaj-e- kafan kehte hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ya hussain aapki mazloomi-o ghurbat ke nisaar<br />
sar ko katwadiya kis shaan se himmat ke nisaar<br />
tah-e-qanjar bhi kiya sajda ibadat ke nisaar<br />
nange sar dekha na hamsheer ko ghairat ke nisaar</p>

<p>ho fida aap pa mu ashko'n se dhone wale<br />
ya hussain aap pa sadkhe ho ye rone wale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekha is bekas-o- mazloom ki shane ghurbat<br />
chote bete ki lahad khodi hai uf ye himmat<br />
kaanpte hatou'n se aaqa ne banaayi turbat<br />
kya kahe'n kis se kahe'n qalb ki apni haalat</p>

<p>chand ko apne tahe qaak chupaya hai abhi<br />
hasliyo'n wale ko turbat me sulaya hai abhi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kis qadar bekas-o mazloom tha ye shah-e- ghareeb<br />
naa kafan chote se sayyad ko huwa us ko naseeb<br />
sar ko katwaaye huwe sote hai sab uske habeeb<br />
pyaas se teen shab-o roz se haalat hai ajeeb</p>

<p>ya ali kehke sambhala hai dil-e- muztar ko<br />
khoo'n bhare kurte me dafnaya ali asghar ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roke dete hai sada-e mah-e anwar bolo<br />
aye mere chote shaheed aye mere dilbar bolo<br />
baap ko chod ke tanha gaye kyu'n kar bolo<br />
dard kaisa hai gale me ali asghar bolo</p>

<p>god me baith ke sab haal sunaana beta<br />
teer ka zaqm bhi daadi ko dikhana beta<br />
____________________________<br />
